# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010794> (Impaired visuospatial constructive cognition)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:10521286") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010794> "Reduced ability affecting mainly visuospatial cognition which may be tested using pattern construction (for example by Differential Ability Scales, which test a person's strengths and weaknesses across a range of intellectual abilities).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010794> "2010-05-10T01:43:01Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010794> "HP:0010794")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010794> "The ability to see an object or picture as a set of parts and then to construct a replica of the original from these parts is known as visuospatial constructive cognition. Impaired visuospatial constructive cognition is one of the characteristic featrues of most patients with Williams-Beuren Syndrome.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010794> "Impaired visuospatial constructive cognition")
