AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010809> "This finding often accompanies a Submucous cleft palate, but this should be coded separately. A longitudinal groove indicating incomplete fusion of the two parts of the uvula may be present with a broadened uvula and has sometimes been called abortive cleft uvula.")
