AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010950> "The fourth ventricle is the cerebral ventricle that extends from the cerebral aqueduct to the obex, and is located within the pons and the upper part of the medulla oblongata.")
