AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010988> "The extrinsic pathway is a protein activation cascade that contributes to blood coagulation and consists of the self-limited process linking exposure and activation of tissue factor to the activation of clotting factor X.")
