# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010990> (Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0010990> "An abnormality of blood coagulation, common pathway.")
