# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011094> (Increased overbite)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9338-3017>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31468724") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011094> "Maxillary teeth cover the mandibular teeth when biting to an increased degree. The feature is defined as a vertical overlap of the maxillary incisors over the mandibular incisors that exceeds 2 mm.")
