AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011441> "The medulla oblongata, which is often referred to simply as the medulla, comprises the medullary reticular formation, inferior olivary complex and cochlear nuclear complex, among other structures.")
