AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011819> "Often, submucous cleft palate is associated with bifid uvula, but this should be coded separately. The muscles of the soft palate may not function properly, leading to speech problems, middle ear disease, and swallowing difficulties.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011819> "Submucous cleft soft palate")
