AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012073> "N-acylglycines result from glycine conjugation with exogenous compounds to enhance their excretion in urine. Glycine conjugation is also an effective detoxification system for preventing accumulation of acyl-CoA esters in several inherited metabolic disorders.")
