AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012075> "A personality disorder is generally associated with significant problems and limitations in relationships, social encounters, work, and school. It usually manifests since childhood or adolescence and continues throughout adulthood.")
