AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012760> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012760> "2014-04-03T12:52:44Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
