AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012805> "Initially, transillumination defects are usually slit-like, but if pigment loss increases, the defects may be become larger and irregularly shaped.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012805> "Iris transillumination defect")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012805> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0008034>)

